<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in quiet trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 53.38 to 6738.87. For the week, the Dow gained 35.32 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 3.24 to 400.38.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.32.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1658 to 795.</p>
<p>Volume was 414,323,260 compared with 485,418,470 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
